================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES AND ACKNOWLEDGMENTS
================================================================================

This web application includes a local client-side WebAssembly (WASM Python) 
implementation of the Primerize 1D algorithm. This implementation builds directly 
on the core biological and thermodynamic models developed by Stanford University's 
Das Lab, making their scientific utilities universally available via client-side 
WebAssembly execution contexts. 

The underlying Primerize engine code is bundled within this software and is 
reused in full compliance with its original licensing terms. The original MIT 
license notice for Primerize is preserved below:

